<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:6ad309e12230034c1e3553ef3a4cd8dea39fa0f0739f483acce3253d483c759c> <https://example.org/slice/text> "5. The shell middens on the south bar are older than the landing, and\nno survey has counted them; the café on the quay sells the smaller ones\nto visitors, which is one reason the count keeps falling every season." .
